# Direct dependencies for reference/chunking_study.py (Feature 022: the chunking study).
#
# torch / transformers / tokenizers / safetensors / numpy / pytrec_eval / huggingface-hub are
# Feature 012's pins (reference/requirements-012.in) — the stack the earlier studies scored
# with, so the scorer and the tokenizer agree with them. chonky is the paragraph splitter
# Feature 021 pinned for the Wikipedia demo (its model is pinned separately in
# reference/models/manifest-chonky.json). The xtriever wheel is not a resolvable requirement:
# it is built locally (cd python && .venv/bin/maturin build --release) and installed into
# this environment afterwards (specs/022-chunking-study/quickstart.md, Step 0).
